To assist you in booking a hotel in Paris for May 1st to May 5th, I will use the `reserve_hotel` function. I need the hotel name, start day, and end day. I will also check for offers to save money. 

```json
{
  "function": "reserve_hotel",
  "arguments": {
    "hotel": "Hotel Wellington",
    "start_day": "2024-05-01",
    "end_day": "2024-05-05"
  }
}
```

